Train and get closer to your dog by playing using Dog Training game with your pet.

Dog Training Game Content & Main Features:
– 50+ Dog Sounds;
– 45+ Dog Training Articles – know how to train your dog from basic to advanced commands and more;
– Training Whistle – train your dog with an ultrasonic whistle;
– No ads!

Note that free version of the game is limited to:
– 5 Dog Sounds;
– 1 Dog Training Article;
– 1 Whistle Use.
If you want to use the game without limits an auto-renewable subscription ”Dog Training Premium” is available.

Auto-renewable Subscription ”Dog Training Premium” Info:
By subscribing you get premium (full, unlimited) access to all the features and content offered by Dog Training game.

Auto-renewable Subscription “Dog Training Premium” Includes:
– Unlock All Sounds;
– Unlock All Training Articles;
– Unlimited Whistle Use;

The game contains the following auto-renewable subscription called ”Dog Training Premium”:
– Weekly (0,99 US$) with a 3-days for free period.
